Wings of small bat
A provident man may find some uses for the wings' leather.

=== LITEM BatWings00_2
Bat wings
They can fetch you a few coins in the shop. Anything at all is useful.

=== LITEM BatWings00_3
Wings of large bat
Its leather has various domestic uses, so it can fetch you a few coins in the shop.

=== LITEM BatWings01
Wings of small fox-bat
They are always in demand, but the price is quite low.

=== LITEM BatWings01_2
Wings of fox-bat
You can sell them and make some money.

=== LITEM BatWings01_3
Wings of large fox-bat
Its leather has various domestic uses, so it can fetch you a few coins in the shop.

=== LITEM BatWings02
